# What EAS Build does NOT send to the builders.
#
# This file is the only list EAS has when the archive is made without git
# (EAS_NO_VCS=1, which keeps it from shallow-cloning the whole repository
# and its 730 MB of history). Without git there is no .gitignore to fall
# back on, so everything that should stay here has to be named below --
# node_modules alone is the difference between a few MB and 860.

# Installed on the builder from package-lock.json, not shipped.
node_modules/

# EAS runs prebuild itself. Sending ours would carry this machine's SDK
# path and its leftover build output.
android/
ios/

# Local only.
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
.kotlin/
.metro-health-check*
*.tsbuildinfo

# The signing key and its password. The CLI reads credentials.json here and
# sends the key over its own API before the archive is made; neither it nor
# a keystore may travel inside it.
credentials.json
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.pem

# Secrets and noise.
.env
.env.*
*.log
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
